  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The purchase is a rank three Ice Crystal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          275
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is again rank three Ice Crystal Gu when Yan Tu takes the Gu as battle stage spoils.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_yan_tu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter describes the Gu worm’s resting look in the aperture. Activation shows the user’s body instead: flesh and blood convert into a diamond-like crystal form, the body grows two to three inches, and the surface reads as hard ice.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a transformation Gu. Once activated, freezing sounds run through the body and the Gu Master becomes a humanoid ice crystal with firmer, colder blades if ice blades are already in use.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In that form, close range hits leave only small scars on the ice, so offense and defense sit in the same transformed body.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It cannot be kept on for long. Extended use can finish the change into ice crystal and leave the user an ice sculpture. Bai Ning Bing pairs it with vitality Gu to hold life force and stretch the safe window, but vitality Gu only prolongs that window; it does not remove the limit.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_vitality_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With Ice Explosion Gu, the transformed ice body also lowers self-injury when an ice blast reaches the user.",
        "chapters": [
          299
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_ice_explosion_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In ice crystal form Bai Ning Bing can keep Frost Breath Gu running without the mouth and tongue freezes that force gaps while she is still in mortal flesh. Against Yan Tu she also runs Ice Crystal Gu with Ice Edge Gu, Swirl Gu, and Tornado Gu while reforming ice blade storm.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_frost_breath_gu",
          "gu_ice_edge_gu",
          "gu_swirl_gu",
          "gu_tornado_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
