  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Shang Clan City, Wei Yang teaches Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing how to pick a direction and build a Gu set. For ice path he names Frost Demon Gu, Snow Fairy Gu, and Ice Crystal Gu as the three most famous transformation type Gu. Bai Ning Bing buys a rank three Ice Crystal Gu for twenty-eight thousand primeval stones and means to make it her vital Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          275
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_wei_yang",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "gu_frost_demon_gu",
          "gu_snow_fairy_gu",
          "sys_vital_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan refines the purchased Gu with Spring Autumn Cicada aura under their poison vow terms, then returns it so Bai Ning Bing can finish refining it as her own.",
        "chapters": [
          277
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "She later treats Ice Crystal Gu as her vital Gu and the core of an ice set that also uses vitality Gu against backlash, with Ice Edge Gu for close range and snowball or icicle Gu for long range.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_icicle_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the battle stage against Tie Dao Ku she activates it as her vital Gu after breaking his close range pressure, then fights in ice crystal form.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_dao_ku"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Yan Tu she brings it out again as her trump card when she needs higher offense, still running vitality Gu beside it.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After she admits defeat, Yan Tu demands the Ice Crystal Gu under battle stage rules. She hands it over; as her vital Gu, losing it makes blood flow from her seven orifices.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Street talk after the match says Ice Crystal Gu is easy to find and that the loss will not weigh heavily on her. Narration states that the lost Gu could be replenished.",
        "chapters": [
          315
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter names a later purchase or trade that returns a second Ice Crystal Gu to Bai Ning Bing.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loss-to-yan-tu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the confrontation hall Bai Ning Bing floats with her whole body turned into ice crystal, looking like her old Qing Mao Mountain self-destruction scene.",
        "chapters": [
          395
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fake-self-destruction-plan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan names Ice Crystal Gu when he sees that form. She then tells Fang Yuan that she chose Ice Crystal Gu so that, paired with Ice Explosion Gu, that ice crystal form could stage a scene like northern dark ice soul physique self-destruction, unlike Snow Fairy Gu whose snow fairy form could not be hidden.",
        "chapters": [
          396
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fake-self-destruction-plan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
